d 'LASSOUR': module to perform adaptive Lasso activation knot unit root tests with sieve wild bootstrap
d
d  lassour tests the unit root null against stationarity using the
d adaptive Lasso activation knot statistics tau and tauIE of Arnold
d and Reinschluessel (2024, arXiv:2404.06205) and their sieve wild
d bootstrap analogues of Arnold and Reinschluessel (2026,
d arXiv:2409.07859). 
d
d KW: unit root
d KW: adaptive lasso
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261018
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f lassour.ado
f lassour.sthlp
f lassour_example.do
f lassour_mata.do
f lassour_methods.sthlp
f llassour.mlib
